abstract: >-
  A normalised, deduplicated and quality-checked derivative of the Ukrainian
  open dataset "Інформація про викрадені, втрачені мобільні телефони"
  (Information on stolen and lost mobile phones), published by the National
  Police of Ukraine on data.gov.ua under CC BY 4.0.

  The source is a single file that is overwritten on every update and carries no
  record status, so neither the lifecycle of a record nor the moment it left the
  register is observable from any single download. This edition reconstructs
  that history from the portal's own revision archive (1742 daily snapshots from
  2019-07-15 onward), and adds device-identifier normalisation (IMEI length
  repair, Luhn validation, TAC extraction), brand and model resolution from a
  free-text field, and per-snapshot data-quality reports.
keywords:
  - open-data
  - ukraine
  - mobile-phones
  - imei
  - data-quality
  - normalization
  - data.gov.ua
  - scd2
